{"availability":"available","full":"YZune/harmattan-qemu","name":"harmattan-qemu","description":"Experimental Nokia N9 / MeeGo Harmattan emulator for Apple Silicon Macs, powered by QEMU. Prebuilt macOS preview and English/Chinese guides.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":13,"forks":1,"created":"2026-09-05T08:59:19Z","updated":"2026-10-16T10:02:37Z","license":"GPL-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://yzune.github.io/harmattan-qemu/","topics":["apple-silicon","emulator","harmattan","macos","meego","nokia-n9","qemu","software-preservation"],"demo":"https://yzune.github.io/harmattan-qemu/watch/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T07:10:22.487Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T07:10:22.487Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T07:10:22.487Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:31.755Z","stars":12,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-17T07:10:22.487Z","stars":13,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An experimental Nokia N9 / MeeGo Harmattan emulator for Apple Silicon Macs. Run the original ARM software and help keep the swipe alive.","Project website · 60-second video demo · YouTube · Download preview · Get the disk and kernel","Harmattan QEMU brings Nokia's experimental N00 board support forward to QEMU 9.1.3 and connects its legacy graphics protocol to a native macOS backend. It runs original Harmattan ARM software: the Home screen, selected applications, the compositor, and the on-screen keyboard."],"features":["OMAP3/N00 board, memory, storage, display, power, and touch-device patches.","A limited EGL/GLES bridge and Nokia DGLES host-library port.","Cocoa display, rotation, input activity, and asynchronous shutdown support.","Opt-in Linux OSMesa rendering and a Godot native frontend for disposable offline sessions.","Guest compatibility helpers for original compositor, orientation, keyboard, and display handoff."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/YZune/harmattan-qemu/blob/main/README.md","fi